[00:30.23]
[00:30.23]It's magic when snowflakes could cling
[00:36.75]雪花停驻在你身上
[00:36.75]Like powdered stardust on your skin glistening
[00:43.35]如同星尘泼洒 晶莹闪烁
[00:43.35]Their moments may be fleet and paper thin
[00:48.92]落雪只可留存片刻
[00:48.92]But through your voyage they will sing
[00:53.52]歌声却会在你的旅途中传唱
[00:53.52]Soaring like the paper plane we dreamed
[00:59.68]如梦中的纸飞机般翱翔
[00:59.68]Coasting through the trails we paved
[01:04.26]飞过我们开辟的航迹
[01:04.26]It's not make believe
[01:06.09]这并非虚幻
[01:06.09]Fly 'til frost turns to spring
[01:10.15]飞吧——直到霜雪化作春意
[01:10.15]Carry the torch for me and spread your wings
[01:15.04]传递炬火 挥展翅膀
[01:15.04]I will cast a glow up from your sky
[01:19.15]在你的天空下投射光芒
[01:19.15]Your ever-guiding light
[01:24.79]永远为你领航
[01:24.79]Names of greats that make history
[01:31.20]再伟大的名字
[01:31.20]Cave in time to fadeaway memories
[01:36.74]在时间的流转中 也会沉淀为被遗忘的尘埃
[01:36.74]But I won't let it faze me
[01:40.77]但我不会因此动摇
[01:40.77]Cause I don't pine for what's to be of me
[01:45.50]因我从不渴求被铭记
[01:45.50]Up in the air
[01:46.61]“漂浮空中”
[01:46.61]Isn't nowhere
[01:49.64]并不等于“无处可去”
[01:49.64]So there's no floating 'round aimlessly
[01:53.09]我并非在漫无目的地漂泊
[01:53.09]Look on up and you'll see
[01:56.71]抬头仰望 你会看到
[01:56.71]It grows and grows and most of all
[01:59.84]那生生不息的
[01:59.84]So alive and bursting with
[02:03.29]正迸发出
[02:03.29]Colors all blossoming
[02:06.04]绽放的万紫千红
[02:06.04]What the plan's been promising
[02:08.66]正如我们心中渴望：
[02:08.66]The end's another new beginning ahead
[02:20.80]终点亦是新的开始
[02:20.80]Did I catch a twinkle in your eye?
[02:27.38]我是否望见了你眼中的星光？
[02:27.38]Did they really mirror mine?
[02:31.81]它可曾映照着我的模样？
[02:31.81]I wanna believe
[02:34.74]我想要相信
[02:34.74]It's what keeps my wish afloat
[02:40.99]让愿望振翅远飞
[02:40.99]I hope you know
[02:47.02]想要传达给你
[02:47.02]Soaring like the paper plane we dreamed
[02:53.25]如梦中的纸飞机般翱翔
[02:53.25]Coasting through the trails we paved
[02:57.83]飞过我们开辟的航迹
[02:57.83]It's not make believe
[02:59.75]这并非朦胧梦境
[02:59.75]Fly 'til frost turns to spring
[03:03.66]飞吧——直到霜雪化作春意
[03:03.66]Carry the torch for me and spread your wings
[03:08.87]传递炬火 挥展翅膀
[03:08.87]I will cast a glow up from your sky
[03:12.88]在你的天空下投射光芒
[03:12.88]Your ever-guiding light
[03:17.80]成为你永远的引路光
[03:17.80]Ooh
